		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_w21_swleader8_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シズイ『おうともよ！
おいは　プラズマだんに　うらみはない▼
ほんまに　わるいことを
しているのかも　しらん▼
みんなが　あいつらは　わるい……！
そう　いってるからって▽
なんにも　かんがえず▼
プラズマだんは　わるいと　きめるのは
おいの　りゅうぎ　ではない！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:13:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:19:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>no data</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:19:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T02:19:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:12:55" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER8
ジムリーダー・シズイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T08:56:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080c0</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_w21_swleader8_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>でも　おまはんらが　こまっとる
それなら　たすけてやらねば　ならん▽
これが　おいの　やりたいことじゃ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:11:36" />
