		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_w21_swleader8_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シズイ『ええか
おはんら　しんねんを　もてよ！▼
うばわれた　ポケモンを
さがすのでも　いい！▼
イッシュを　こおりづけ　から
まもる　ためでも　いい！▼
りゆうは　なんでも　いい
じぶんは　なぜ　そうするのか？▼
しんねんの　つよさが　ポケモンと
じぶんに　ちからを　くれるたい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:24:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:08:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>no data</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:08:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:08:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:12:55" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER8
ジムリーダー・シズイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:08:46" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080c0</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_w21_swleader8_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ほな　きをつけて　いけよ！▼
うえで　さわいで　しまったから
みんな　まちかまえて　いるたい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:15:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:11:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ほな　気をつけて　いけよ！▼
上で　騒いでしまったから
みんな　待ち構えて　いるたい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:26:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:11:40" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・表示後、c14方面に去っていく
・続けて</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-17T09:26:31" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER8
ジムリーダー・シズイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
